                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e3df6837-9d54-30ae-a539-5a961d369644",
                        "entry_id": "f171c68d-0c35-35fb-8e63-0902b408e478",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to make cheaper, to reduce the price of, to cheapen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d240254-c1e2-48f7-b6f0-56d790e6aae2",
                                "sense_id": "e3df6837-9d54-30ae-a539-5a961d369644",
                                "text": "Зада́ча всеми́рной торго́вли и состои́т в том, чтоб удешеви́ть э́ти предме́ты, сде́лать досту́пными везде́ и всю́ду те сре́дства и удо́бства, к кото́рым челове́к привы́к у себя́ до́ма.",
                                "translation": "The task of world trade is to make all these things inexpensive enough so that they can be had everywhere, all the conveniences to which man is used to having at home.",
                                "english": "The task of world trade is to make all these things inexpensive enough so that they can be had everywhere, all the conveniences to which man is used to having at home."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
